            "title": "Spirit Airlines to furlough 1,800 flight attendants amid second bankruptcy",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Spirit Airlines plans to furlough 1,800 flight attendants before the end of the year, the cash-strapped budget carrier said Monday.  The company said it made the \u201cdifficult decision\u201d to put cabin crew members on temporary leave to match staffing needs with expected flight demand during Spirit's second bankruptcy in a year.  Spirit filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection last month and subsequently announced that it planned to suspend operations in about a dozen U.S. cities beginning in October.",
